OL,3,GNEWSAPoppy seller, 6, launches annual
OL,4,Aappeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the country's youngest poppy
OL,7,Fsellers, six-year-old Ivy
OL,8,FKnighton-Leake has launched the annual
OL,9,FPoppy Appeal for the Royal British
OL,10,FLegion.
OL,12,FIvy, from Bradford, has been taking
OL,13,Fpart in the annual fundraiser alongside
OL,14,Fher father Steve Knighton, 41, who was
OL,15,Fa member of the Royal Signals, since
OL,16,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
