OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPoppy seller, 6, launches annual
OL,4,Aappeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the 2026 launch in Manchester
OL,7,Fearlier, Ivy received a special poppy
OL,8,Fmade from the metal of World War Two
OL,9,FSpitfires, awarded to her by Pte Katie
OL,10,FBrazier, 22, from the Royal Anglian
OL,11,FRegiment.
OL,13,FSteve, who was supported by the the
OL,14,Fcharity to adjust to life outside the
OL,15,Fmilitary when he left the Army after
OL,16,Fsix years, said he was "unbelievably
OL,17,Fproud".
